  "captions": {
    "full-narration-v4": [
      {
        "text": "声明：本视频完全没有使用A畜的产品制作。大家好！",
        "startMs": 100,
        "endMs": 4740,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A畜终于提交上市申请了，",
        "startMs": 4980,
        "endMs": 6740,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "我整理了10条相关的关键信息，",
        "startMs": 7160,
        "endMs": 9260,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "以方便你有理有据地骂A畜",
        "startMs": 9520,
        "endMs": 12100,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 1 节：上市申请。",
        "startMs": 12540,
        "endMs": 14020,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 年 10 月，",
        "startMs": 14760,
        "endMs": 15520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c12"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Anthropic 提交上市申请，",
        "startMs": 16080,
        "endMs": 17680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c13"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "计划在纳斯达克用 ANT 代码挂牌。",
        "startMs": 18040,
        "endMs": 20540,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c14"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "对普通用户来说，这意味着这家做 Claude 的公司，",
        "startMs": 21040,
        "endMs": 23980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c15",
          "run-0-c16",
          "run-0-c17"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "要把更多经营细节摆到台面上了。",
        "startMs": 23980,
        "endMs": 26860,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c18"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "看看它一边怎么讲安全，一边怎么做生意。",
        "startMs": 27000,
        "endMs": 29620,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c19",
          "run-0-c20"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "比如创始人 Dario 公开主张限制向中国出售先进芯片。",
        "startMs": 30060,
        "endMs": 34560,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c21-p1",
          "run-0-c21-p2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "对中国用户来说，这关系到你能接触到什么技术。",
        "startMs": 35280,
        "endMs": 38720,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c22",
          "run-0-c23"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "公司当然可以谈安全，但把安全和技术竞争放在一张桌上谈，",
        "startMs": 39280,
        "endMs": 44220,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c24",
          "run-0-c25"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "就别指望大家只听见安全两个字。",
        "startMs": 44580,
        "endMs": 47280,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c26"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 2 节：收入与增长。",
        "startMs": 47720,
        "endMs": 49520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c27",
          "run-0-c28"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "先看它赚钱有多快。2023 年收入 4,100 万美元，",
        "startMs": 49840,
        "endMs": 53620,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c29",
          "run-0-c30"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2025 年到了 45.85 亿美元，",
        "startMs": 54020,
        "endMs": 56120,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c31"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 年第二季度就有 115.55 亿美元。",
        "startMs": 56720,
        "endMs": 59680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c32"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "你可能还在琢磨订阅值不值，",
        "startMs": 60060,
        "endMs": 61700,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c33"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它那边的生意已经跑得飞快。",
        "startMs": 62060,
        "endMs": 63580,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c34",
          "run-0-c35",
          "run-0-c36"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "赚钱快，花钱也猛。2026 年第二季度，",
        "startMs": 63940,
        "endMs": 67540,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c37",
          "run-0-c38",
          "run-0-c39"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "算力和基础设施费用 55.58 亿美元，",
        "startMs": 67900,
        "endMs": 71160,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c40"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "收入约是这笔费用的 2.08 倍，",
        "startMs": 71580,
        "endMs": 74140,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c41",
          "run-0-c42",
          "run-0-c43"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "营业利润 9.74 亿美元。",
        "startMs": 74520,
        "endMs": 76800,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c44"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "不过算力不是全部成本，不能把这个比例当利润率。对用户来说，",
        "startMs": 77180,
        "endMs": 81880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c45",
          "run-0-c46",
          "run-0-c47"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "成本压力值得关注，但不能凭这组数字断言它一定涨价。",
        "startMs": 82200,
        "endMs": 86880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c48",
          "run-0-c49",
          "run-0-c50"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 3 节：亏损与会计。",
        "startMs": 87180,
        "endMs": 89640,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c51",
          "run-0-c52"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "接下来的数字看着吓人：2026 年上半年净亏损 807.48 亿美元。",
        "startMs": 90040,
        "endMs": 96060,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c53",
          "run-0-c54",
          "run-0-c55"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "其中大约 723.88 亿，",
        "startMs": 96440,
        "endMs": 98920,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c56-p1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "是融资工具价值变动带来的会计费用。",
        "startMs": 98920,
        "endMs": 102120,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c56-p2",
          "run-0-c57"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "说人话，就是账上有一大笔变化，",
        "startMs": 102540,
        "endMs": 105520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c58",
          "run-0-c59"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "不等于公司当天真拿现金付出这么多。",
        "startMs": 105940,
        "endMs": 108200,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c60",
          "run-0-c61"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "公司另披露调整后净利润 26.71 亿美元，口径不同，",
        "startMs": 108840,
        "endMs": 113940,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c62",
          "run-0-c63"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "别拿来直接相减。普通用户不用替它做会计，",
        "startMs": 114200,
        "endMs": 117440,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c64",
          "run-0-c65"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "但看到亏损天文数字，也不用立刻以为 Claude 明天就要关门。",
        "startMs": 117780,
        "endMs": 121740,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c66-p1",
          "run-0-c66-p2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 4 节：Bartz 版权案。",
        "startMs": 122280,
        "endMs": 124600,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c67",
          "run-0-c68"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "如果你写文章、画画、出书，",
        "startMs": 125020,
        "endMs": 127840,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c69",
          "run-0-c70",
          "run-0-c71"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这一条尤其值得听。2024 年，",
        "startMs": 128300,
        "endMs": 130860,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c72",
          "run-0-c73"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "作家 Andrea Bartz 等人起诉 Anthropic，",
        "startMs": 131180,
        "endMs": 134960,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c74",
          "run-0-c75"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "争议涉及作品被用于训练。",
        "startMs": 135300,
        "endMs": 137080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c76"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 年 7 月，法院最终批准了 15 亿美元的集体和解。",
        "startMs": 137640,
        "endMs": 141420,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c77",
          "run-0-c78",
          "run-0-c79"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Anthropic 曾从盗版来源下载书籍；",
        "startMs": 141940,
        "endMs": 144660,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c80"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "另一边，它又指控竞争者未经许可蒸馏 Claude。",
        "startMs": 145060,
        "endMs": 148900,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c81"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "两件事的法律问题不同，但作为创作者，",
        "startMs": 149340,
        "endMs": 152120,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c82",
          "run-0-c83",
          "run-0-c84"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "你完全可以问一句：拿别人的作品训练时一套说法，",
        "startMs": 152300,
        "endMs": 155880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c85",
          "run-0-c86",
          "run-0-c87"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "轮到别人碰自己的模型又一套说法，",
        "startMs": 156180,
        "endMs": 158440,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c88",
          "run-0-c89"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这是不是太会替自己讲道理了？",
        "startMs": 158780,
        "endMs": 161120,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c90"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 5 节：客户与政策执行。",
        "startMs": 161440,
        "endMs": 163880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c91",
          "run-0-c92"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "公司说，截至 2026 年 9 月底，",
        "startMs": 164420,
        "endMs": 167120,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c93",
          "run-0-c94"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "净收入留存率约 900%。通俗说，",
        "startMs": 167380,
        "endMs": 170680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c95",
          "run-0-c96"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "符合它统计条件的老客户，",
        "startMs": 171040,
        "endMs": 172980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c97",
          "run-0-c98"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后来贡献的收入变成了原来的九倍左右。注意，",
        "startMs": 173240,
        "endMs": 176800,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c99",
          "run-0-c100",
          "run-0-c101",
          "run-0-c102"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这不是说每个人的订阅都涨了九倍；",
        "startMs": 176900,
        "endMs": 178880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c103",
          "run-0-c104"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "固定价格的 Claude Pro 和 Max 不在这项统计里。",
        "startMs": 179160,
        "endMs": 182200,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c105",
          "run-0-c106",
          "run-0-c107"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "公司估计，2026 年前九个月，",
        "startMs": 182520,
        "endMs": 185220,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c108",
          "run-0-c109"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "约 5% 到 7% 的收入来自后来被认定违反政策或商业条款的客户。公司说，",
        "startMs": 185680,
        "endMs": 192140,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c110",
          "run-0-c111",
          "run-0-c112",
          "run-0-c113"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "发现问题、调查到执行都需要时间，",
        "startMs": 192460,
        "endMs": 195420,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c114",
          "run-0-c115"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "所以是在提供服务时确认收入，",
        "startMs": 195980,
        "endMs": 198260,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c116"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "随后才限制或终止访问。再看普通用户的退款：",
        "startMs": 198600,
        "endMs": 202460,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c117",
          "run-0-c118",
          "run-0-c119"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Claude 官方规则是，除条款明确规定或法律要求的情况，",
        "startMs": 202900,
        "endMs": 206880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c120",
          "run-0-c121"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "付款原则上不退款。换成用户视角就是：",
        "startMs": 207260,
        "endMs": 210180,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c122",
          "run-0-c123"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "服务可能被停，想拿回钱还得看你符不符合例外。",
        "startMs": 210520,
        "endMs": 214220,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c124",
          "run-0-c125"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "安全的牌子挂得这么高，封号之后钱怎么算，",
        "startMs": 214840,
        "endMs": 217860,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c126",
          "run-0-c127",
          "run-0-c128",
          "run-0-c129"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "总得给用户讲明白吧？",
        "startMs": 218220,
        "endMs": 219780,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c130"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第 6 节：长期算力承诺。",
        "startMs": 220120,
        "endMs": 222480,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c131",
          "run-0-c132"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "你每发一次消息，背后都要用算力。",
        "startMs": 222840,
        "endMs": 225320,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c133"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "为了买这些资源，Anthropic 签下多年大合同。",
        "startMs": 226340,
        "endMs": 229520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c134",
          "run-0-c135",
          "run-0-c136"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "接下来有三种数字：最低要付多少、预计还会买多少、最多允许买多少。",
        "startMs": 229840,
        "endMs": 235440,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c137",
          "run-0-c138",
          "run-0-c139",
          "run-0-c140"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它们不是同一种账，不能直接加起来。",
        "startMs": 235840,
        "endMs": 238160,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c141",
          "run-0-c142"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "先看 Google：2026 年 4 月到 2033 年 7 月，",
        "startMs": 238440,
        "endMs": 242060,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c143",
          "run-0-c144"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "最低支出承诺约 1,145 亿美元。",
        "startMs": 242420,
        "endMs": 245840,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c145",
          "run-0-c146"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "公司还预计从包括 Google 在内的供应商额外采购约 1,250 亿到 1,500 亿美元的 TPU 资源，",
        "startMs": 246140,
        "endMs": 253700,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c147",
